WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.044 --> 00:00:03.922
Two years passed.

2
00:00:03.923 --> 00:00:09.735
Beauty made the cottage a home.

3
00:00:09.736 --> 00:00:12.862
She made curtains.

4
00:00:12.863 --> 00:00:16.255
She planted a garden.

5
00:00:16.256 --> 00:00:25.192
Beauty loved cooking.

6
00:00:25.193 --> 00:00:29.107
But she loved her flowers best of all.

7
00:00:29.108 --> 00:00:34.244
Her favorite was a small rosebush.

8
00:00:34.245 --> 00:00:38.990
One day Beauty was in the garden.

9
00:00:38.991 --> 00:00:42.664
Her roses were ready to bloom.

10
00:00:42.665 --> 00:00:47.390
Father came outside and sat down.

11
00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:57.001
"He looks so tired," Beauty thought.

12
00:00:57.002 --> 00:00:59.152
Father looked at her.

13
00:00:59.153 --> 00:01:02.249
"You should go live in town.

14
00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:05.339
A young girl needs friends."

15
00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:09.103
"But I do have friends," Beauty said.

16
00:01:09.104 --> 00:01:13.756
Father was surprised. "Who?"

17
00:01:13.757 --> 00:01:17.541
Beauty pointed to the edge of the forest.

18
00:01:17.542 --> 00:01:20.635
A deer stood watching them.

19
00:01:20.636 --> 00:01:25.301
Her big brown eyes were soft and gentle.

20
00:01:25.302 --> 00:01:33.222
Father laughed. "You're very funny, Beauty!

21
00:01:33.223 --> 00:01:35.702
I'm going fishing.

22
00:01:35.703 --> 00:01:40.957
I'll try to catch us some dinner."

23
00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:45.092
"Father thinks I'm joking," Beauty thought.

24
00:01:45.093 --> 00:01:49.181
But the deer was her friend.

25
00:01:49.182 --> 00:01:53.604
Sometimes she brought Beauty fruit.

26
00:01:53.605 --> 00:01:59.698
Other times she brought flowers.

27
00:01:59.699 --> 00:02:09.179
Beauty gave the deer food from her garden.

28
00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:13.141
Beauty went over to the deer.

29
00:02:13.142 --> 00:02:16.678
"Did you bring me something today?"

30
00:02:16.679 --> 00:02:19.524
The deer shook her head.

31
00:02:19.525 --> 00:02:22.645
"That's okay," Beauty said.

32
00:02:22.646 --> 00:02:25.401
"I'm happy to see you."

33
00:02:25.402 --> 00:02:28.102
Beauty stroked the deer's nose.

34
00:02:28.103 --> 00:02:31.863
The deer gently pushed Beauty's hand.

35
00:02:31.864 --> 00:02:35.283
Then she nodded toward the forest.

36
00:02:35.284 --> 00:02:40.662
Beauty was confused. "You want me to follow you?"

37
00:02:40.663 --> 00:02:43.158
The deer nodded.

38
00:02:43.159 --> 00:02:45.556
Beauty smiled.

39
00:02:45.557 --> 00:02:49.954
It seemed like the deer wanted to show her something.

40
00:02:49.955 --> 00:02:56.487
She wanted to go, but Father always warned her.

41
00:02:56.488 --> 00:03:04.099
"The forest is cursed! A monster lives there!"

42
00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:09.920
Beauty turned back to the deer. "I'm sorry.

43
00:03:09.921 --> 00:03:12.684
I can't go. Father says—"

44
00:03:12.685 --> 00:03:25.045
"Beauty!" Suddenly Father came running.

45
00:03:25.046 --> 00:03:29.053
He was jumping for joy.

46
00:03:29.054 --> 00:03:32.714
"I have the best news!

47
00:03:32.715 --> 00:03:36.945
Finally . . . my ship came in!"

